Package: com.wcvoicekeep
Name: wcvoicekeep
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: LaunchDaemon that keeps WeChat Keyboard (Wetype) main app alive in the background and relaunches it if it dies, so voice input no longer needs the foreground jump. True zero-jump (not an animation-removal hack).
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Utilities
